{
  "_readme": "Triple i Oman tax rules library v1. Rules are data, not code (plan decision 5). Each rule has an effective date and a source citation. Items with verify=true are [VERIFY] items from plan section 12 and MUST be confirmed with an Omani tax adviser before the related feature is relied on in production. On first boot these are seeded into the TaxRule table as APPROVED version 1; later changes go through four-eyes approval in the admin console.",
